好</div>\r\n\r\n              <p>欢迎来到我的博客。</p>\r\n\r\n              <p>这里主要记录我在编程学习、 开发实践以及技术探索过程中的一些 思考和总结。</p>\r\n\r\n              <p>希望通过持续记录，把零散的知识 逐渐整理成自己的技术体系。</p>\r\n            </section>\r\n\r\n            <!-- =========================\r\n                 技术方向\r\n                 ========================= -->\r\n\r\n            <section class=\"about-section\">\r\n              <div class=\"about-section-title\">技术方向</div>\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"skill-list\">\r\n                <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                  <div class=\"skill-name\">JavaScript</div>\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"skill-line\">Web 开发、异步编程、现代 JavaScript</div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                  <div class=\"skill-name\">Vue</div>\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"skill-line\">Vue 生态、组件化开发、VuePress</div>\r\n                </div>\r\n\r\n                <div class=\"skill-item\">\r\n                  <div class=\"skill-name\">Git</div>\r\n\r\n                  <div class=\"skill-line\">版本控制、项目协作、GitHub</div>\r\n                </div>\r\n              </div>\r\n            </section>\r\n\r\n            <!-- =========================\r\n                 博客\r\n                 ========================= -->\r\n\r\n            <section class=\"about-section\">\r\n              <div class=\"about-section-title\">关于这个博客</div>\r\n\r\n              <p>这个博客主要用于记录学习过程中的 技术文章、开发笔记和一些实践经验。</p>\r\n\r\n              <p>博客使用 VuePress 构建，并部署在 GitHub Pages。</p>\r\n            </section>\r\n\r\n            <!-- =========================\r\n                 座右铭\r\n                 ========================= -->\r\n\r\n            <section class=\"about-quote\">\r\n              <div class=\"quote-mark\">“</div>\r\n\r\n              <p>不积跬步，无以至千里。</p>\r\n\r\n              <div class=\"quote-author\">持续学习，持续记录。</div>\r\n            </section>\r\n\r\n            <!-- =========================\r\n                 GitHub\r\n                 ========================= -->\r\n\r\n            <section class=\"about-links\">\r\n              <a href=\"https://github.com/FMdenuit530\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" class=\"about-github\">\r\n                <span> GitHub </span>\r\n\r\n                <span> ↗ </span>\r\n              </a>\r\n            </section>\r\n          </div>\r\n        </section>\r\n      </main>\r\n    </template>\r\n  </ParentLayout>\r\n</template>\r\n\r\n<script>\r\nimport ParentLayout from '@parent-theme/layouts/Layout.vue'\r\n\r\nexport default {\r\n  name: 'About',\r\n\r\n  components: {\r\n    ParentLayout,\r\n  },\r\n}\r\n</script>\r\n\r\n<style scoped>\r\n/* =========================\r\n   页面\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n.about-page {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n\r\n  min-height: 100vh;\r\n\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================\r\n   Hero\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n.about-hero {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n\r\n  padding: 100px 20px 55px;\r\n\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-hero-inner {\r\n  max-width: 900px;\r\n\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n\r\n  padding: 0 30px;\r\n\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-kicker {\r\n  margin-bottom: 15px;\r\n\r\n  color: #aaa;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n\r\n  letter-spacing: 0.18em;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-hero h1 {\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n\r\n  color: #2c3e50;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 2.7rem;\r\n\r\n  font-weight: 700;\r\n\r\n  line-height: 1.3;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-intro {\r\n  margin: 15px 0 0;\r\n\r\n  color: #888;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 16px;\r\n\r\n  line-height: 1.8;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================\r\n   内容\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n.about-content {\r\n  width: 100%;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-content-inner {\r\n  max-width: 900px;\r\n\r\n  margin: 0 auto;\r\n\r\n  padding: 0 30px 80px;\r\n\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================\r\n   内容段落\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n.about-section {\r\n  padding: 35px 0;\r\n\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #eeeeee;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-section:first-child {\r\n  padding-top: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-section-title {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n\r\n  gap: 14px;\r\n\r\n  margin-bottom: 20px;\r\n\r\n  color: #2c3e50;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 17px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-section-title::after {\r\n  content: '';\r\n\r\n  width: 55px;\r\n\r\n  height: 1px;\r\n\r\n  background: #eeeeee;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-section p {\r\n  max-width: 720px;\r\n\r\n  margin: 12px 0;\r\n\r\n  color: #666;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n\r\n  line-height: 2;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================\r\n   技术方向\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n.skill-list {\r\n  display: flex;\r\n\r\n  flex-direction: column;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.skill-item {\r\n  display: grid;\r\n\r\n  grid-template-columns: 140px 1fr;\r\n\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n\r\n  gap: 20px;\r\n\r\n  padding: 17px 0;\r\n\r\n  border-bottom: 1px solid #f2f2f2;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.skill-item:last-child {\r\n  border-bottom: none;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.skill-name {\r\n  color: #3eaf7c;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 15px;\r\n\r\n  font-weight: 600;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.skill-line {\r\n  color: #888;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 14px;\r\n\r\n  line-height: 1.7;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================\r\n   引用\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n.about-quote {\r\n  position: relative;\r\n\r\n  margin: 45px 0;\r\n\r\n  padding: 30px 35px;\r\n\r\n  border-left: 2px solid #3eaf7c;\r\n\r\n  background: #fafcfb;\r\n\r\n  box-sizing: border-box;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quote-mark {\r\n  position: absolute;\r\n\r\n  top: 8px;\r\n\r\n  left: 18px;\r\n\r\n  color: #dcefe5;\r\n\r\n  font-family: Georgia, serif;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 54px;\r\n\r\n  line-height: 1;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-quote p {\r\n  position: relative;\r\n\r\n  margin: 0;\r\n\r\n  color: #555;\r\n\r\n  font-family: Georgia, 'Noto Serif SC', serif;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 19px;\r\n\r\n  line-height: 1.8;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.quote-author {\r\n  position: relative;\r\n\r\n  margin-top: 10px;\r\n\r\n  color: #aaa;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 12px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================\r\n   GitHub\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n.about-links {\r\n  padding-top: 10px;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-github {\r\n  display: inline-flex;\r\n\r\n  align-items: center;\r\n\r\n  gap: 10px;\r\n\r\n  padding: 10px 16px;\r\n\r\n  border: 1px solid #e5ebe8;\r\n\r\n  border-radius: 6px;\r\n\r\n  color: #666;\r\n\r\n  font-size: 13px;\r\n\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n\r\n  transition: border-color 0.2s ease, color 0.2s ease, transform 0.2s ease;\r\n}\r\n\r\n.about-github:hover {\r\n  border-color: #cfe8da;\r\n\r\n  color: #3eaf7c;\r\n\r\n  text-decoration: none;\r\n\r\n  transform: translateY(-2px);\r\n}\r\n\r\n/* =========================\r\n   手机\r\n   ========================= */\r\n\r\n@media (max-width: 719px) {\r\n  .about-hero {\r\n    padding: 82px 18px 45px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-hero-inner {\r\n    padding: 0 2px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-hero h1 {\r\n    font-size: 2.2rem;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-intro {\r\n    font-size: 14px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-content-inner {\r\n    padding: 0 18px 55px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-section {\r\n    padding: 28px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-section:first-child {\r\n    padding-top: 8px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-section p {\r\n    font-size: 14px;\r\n\r\n    line-height: 1.9;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .skill-item {\r\n    grid-template-columns: 1fr;\r\n\r\n    gap: 5px;\r\n\r\n    padding: 15px 0;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .skill-line {\r\n    font-size: 13px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-quote {\r\n    margin: 35px 0;\r\n\r\n    padding: 25px 25px;\r\n  }\r\n\r\n  .about-quote p {\r\n    font-size: 17px;\r\n  }\r\n}\r\n</style>\r\n"]}]}